{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26066","headline":"风筝 · 鲍溶","name":"风筝","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"何响与天通，瑶筝挂望中。\n彩弦非触指，锦瑟忽闻风。\n鴈柱虚连势，鸾歌且坠空。\n夜和霜击磬，晴引凤归桐。\n幽咽谁生怨，清泠自匪躬。\n秦姬收宝匣，搔首不成功。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"鲍溶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26066.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26066","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}